  "caption": "Regex pass rate per WorkspaceBench family (n=100 items each, k=1 sample per cell, Wilson 95% CIs). At the matched layer 42 the NLA ties Oracle Lens on typo and beats it on the other three; the published Oracle Lens score counts an item as passed if any of 11 layers (20 to 60, step 4) passes, which adds +0.08 to +0.22 over Oracle Lens's best single layer per family (numbers above). Caveat: any-of-11 is also a best-of-11-samples bonus, so part of it is sampling, not layer choice; layer 42 is off Oracle Lens's training grid but matches its on-grid neighbours, layers 40 and 44. Best single layers: typo correction layer 24, multilingual concept layer 56, multi-hop bridge layer 56, basic readout layer 56.",
